The cache-miss profile shows weight conversion kernels are small on the CUDA timeline; the bigger issue remains the four core stages. I’m still keeping the original-weight idea in view for smaller cases, but first I’m checking reproducible event timings with fresh weights to match leaderboard behavior.
codex
